sequenceDiagram
    actor S as 学生
    participant FE as 前端页面
    participant API as 后端 API
    participant DB as MySQL

    S->>FE: 点击课程卡片"选课"按钮
    FE->>API: POST /api/courses/{id}/enroll/
    API->>DB: 将当前用户加入课程学生名单
    DB-->>API: 成功
    API-->>FE: 200 enrolled
    FE->>API: GET /api/courses/（刷新）
    API-->>FE: is_enrolled=true
    FE-->>S: 卡片标记变为"我选的"
    Note over S,DB: 备选：教师选课 → 400"教师不能选课"<br/>退课：POST /api/courses/{id}/unenroll/ 从名单移除
